  [server]        `--use-fsdp-inference true` to shard DiT weights with FSDP. FSDP is not a
  [server]        single-GPU substitute for CPU offload.
  [server]   - If the OOM occurs during runtime:
  [server]     1. Reduce resolution, `--num-frames`, or batch size.
  [server]     2. Use `--performance-mode memory` for lower memory usage.
  [server]     3. Enable SP/Ulysses/Ring for sequence-heavy workloads in multi-GPU setups.
  [server]     4. Use FSDP, with CFG parallelism when supported, for validated multi-GPU workloads.
  [server]     5. Use a lower-memory attention backend or quantization when available.
